{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1102625-revising-pentex-less-captain-planet-more-substance","id":1102625,"title":"Revising Pentex - Less Captain Planet, More Substance","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-06-11T15:23:55-07:00","id":1102625,"title":"Revising Pentex - Less Captain Planet, More Substance","content":"I love Pentex but it's always been the redheaded stepchild of Werewolf games for me. They're fine as antagonists but I never quite bought them the way I bought, say, the Sabbat or Technocracy or even the Camarilla. It's not like I had a problem with the idea of evil corporations, Gaia knows that we've got plenty of cartoonishly evil ones in real life but their motivations are consistant with human greed as well as short-sightedness.<br /> <br /> Whereas apocalyptic nihilism kind of jars with the self-entitled rich douchebags of RL. Even the Pentex masterplan of taking over the world seems a little dull compared to the Union. Wolfram and Hart is, ironically, probably the closest thing I can think of to a &quot;serious&quot; version of how Pentex is supposed to operate. However, that presupposes the Senior Partners really were demon gods in another world with the human servants firmly under boot. Really, in W:TA you'd think Pentex would be more the Weaver or merely manipulated into fighting the Garou. But we have what we have with them. I have my ideas and revisions for them.<br /> <br /> So, how would you do Pentex?<br /> <br /> This is a thread for identifying the flaws in the game, presenting them better, or even twiddling with them so they work as antagonists for the Garou.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-11T16:29:00-07:00","id":1102645,"title":"","content":"One idea, the wyrm lied to them about will happen after it wins, The Pentex execs honestly think the world will renew after the Apocalypse and they get a big say what the new world will be like and will have the opportunity to make it better (after all, most hyper-capitalist assholes really do think they are helping people despite what everyone else thinks, being out of touch and all. And all the best villains think they are good guys)<br /> <br /> Also, the wyrm's forces probably gave them a very biased account of the Garou's history that focuses on things like the impergium and such","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-11T16:48:41-07:00","id":1102649,"title":"","content":"&quot;What appocalypse? People have been saying the world has been ending as long as we've had people and we are still here. You know what's real? Next quarter's earnings that's what's real&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-11T17:28:36-07:00","id":1102657,"title":"","content":"I honestly loved the Pentex we got in Book of the Wyrm 20. And I say that as a fan of all of the other Pentex family-related books we've gotten in the past(with Freak Legion being my favorite). <br /> <br /> If anything, maybe a bit darker? I'm curious to see the Pentex Employee handbook should that ever come out : P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&quot;Steel isn't strong, boy. Flesh is stronger.&quot;</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/95-fat-larry","name":"Fat Larry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar95_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1337"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-11T18:06:08-07:00","id":1102666,"title":"","content":"I'm going to call this right now. The term &quot;Captain Planet&quot; no longer has any meaning with regard to Werewolf. Especially given the general lack of joke names, or the plots that look way more like Mage than anything else. A machine that changes bodies and minds as a &quot;critique&quot; of technology used without responsibility? You're in the wrong game for that. You want the next corridor over.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The young man in the cafe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1102625-revising-pentex-less-captain-planet-more-substance?p=1102645#post1102645\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">One idea, the wyrm lied to them about will happen after it wins, The Pentex execs honestly think the world will renew after the Apocalypse and they get a big say what the new world will be like and will have the opportunity to make it better (after all, most hyper-capitalist assholes really do think they are helping people despite what everyone else thinks, being out of touch and all. And all the best villains think they are good guys)<br /> <br /> Also, the wyrm's forces probably gave them a very biased account of the Garou's history that focuses on things like the impergium and such</div> </div> </div> </div>The Wyrm would never have fucking told anyone at any level of the holding company any of this, because it's too big to talk to them, and its avatars are all out to lunch. Even the servants of the corrupt side of it wouldn't have really given anyone jack didley on the inside track, because they don't need to, and no one in the company actually cares one way or the other. The company does what it does and feeds them in the course of pursuing the bottom line. It makes money off of negligence because of lacking protections for both workers and the world around them. Ever taken a class on environmental regulations? They're some of the most toothless standards that anyone can wriggle out of, usually dodging behind &quot;but the jobs!&quot; And that's in the real world, not in the WoD.<br /> <br /> As a whole, Pentex doesn't quite work like the cults of old. It's bad for business. They don't worship evil gods and dress in robes, because that's incredibly unprofessional, and no one would ever admit to anything occult in the first place. That's why fomori are known as NSUs instead of people with an evil spirit inside of them. That's why there's an elaborate code of spook speak for illegal operations and plenty of deniability to go around. That's why Pentex isn't something people know is a thing, by and large, even among Garou and Fera.<br /> <br /> This is in the books. This has been the standard since 2nd edition's Book of the Wyrm, and it trimmed more of the fat off when Revised came around. Pentex subsidiaries don't need to put strange chemicals into products to ruin peoples' lives. They do it just fine being a normally-cut corporation. Even the monstrous leadership doesn't really do much to enhance that very much.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-11T18:34:22-07:00","id":1102675,"title":"","content":"While Pentex is the worst of the worst when it come to corporations, the majority of corporations are going to create Banes (and Fomori) through environmental degradation and labor violations. The real questions are how many corporations know that they are creating Banes (and Fomori) and how many of them are capable of exploiting Banes (and Fomori)?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-11T19:08:30-07:00","id":1102679,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Fat Larry</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1102625-revising-pentex-less-captain-planet-more-substance?p=1102657#post1102657\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm curious to see the Pentex Employee handbook should that ever come out : P</div> </div> </div> </div>Yea...I've been wondering about that myself since the KS ended what? 3 years ago?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1179-celtspz","name":"CeltSPZ","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"835"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-11T22:43:51-07:00","id":1102710,"title":"","content":"I would just not use Pentex, use real or at least realistic corporations instead. I think that does by this kind introduces more nuanced problems for players to deal with. More shades of gray, just like real environmental issues. <br /> <br /> I think that it might be interesting to make Pentex a conspiracy theory. That is to say, make a game where players and their characters believe that there is this huge shadowy mega-corporation that is behind pollution and envionrmental destruction. Then as players delve deeper, they learn that there is no such thing - it's just a bunch of normal humans doing what they do to make a buck.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1129-sergeant-brother","name":"Sergeant Brother","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1129_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-11T23:18:00-07:00","id":1102713,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sergeant Brother</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1102625-revising-pentex-less-captain-planet-more-substance?p=1102710#post1102710\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would just not use Pentex, use real or at least realistic corporations instead. I think that does by this kind introduces more nuanced problems for players to deal with. More shades of gray, just like real environmental issues.<br /> <br /> I think that it might be interesting to make Pentex a conspiracy theory. That is to say, make a game where players and their characters believe that there is this huge shadowy mega-corporation that is behind pollution and envionrmental destruction. Then as players delve deeper, they learn that there is no such thing - it's just a bunch of normal humans doing what they do to make a buck.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, that kind of cuts to the essential problem, doesn't it?<br /> <br /> You don't use Pentex to talk about the despoiling of a town with chemical waste, you use Pentex to generate Formori monsters your players can kill with their klaives.<br /> <br /> It's not really about them being a corporation but them being an ENEMY.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-11T23:44:01-07:00","id":1102718,"title":"","content":"Yeah, Pentex was originally there to explain why a commando unit made up of highly trained fomori equipped with the latest technology might suddenly kick in the door to the local caern. You need someone making the monsters, training the monsters, equipping the monsters, and directing the monsters at the players. Plus, Pentex did double duty as social commentary on real life corporations and industries. Getting rid of Pentex means now you're going to have to come up with a new shadowy organization who's making and training the monsters that the PC's are fighting.<br /> <br /> Generally speaking in my games, when I want to run a game dealing with human greed causing problems, I tend to use entirely normal, mortal companies, businesses and corporations. There are plenty of those in the world, and plenty who are willing to put profit ahead of safety. When I choose to use Pentex or one of their subsidiaries, it's because I want an enemy for the players to confront, not someone who is just making bad choices.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":741,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","user":"AnubisXy","date":". 06-12-2017, 02:46 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-12T02:18:39-07:00","id":1102741,"title":"","content":"Well I would have a dash more, people using supernatural powers to make money rather then go on an Antichrist Crusade, and a sprinkle of consequences for when they all that time and money to successful werewolf actions. I mean seriously its not cost effective for Pentex to have been funding a secret Amazon war with 1000 Wolfmen since the 80's.<br /> <br /> In Vampire people cultivate their resources, with Pentex they just flush it all away yet still don't suffer loses. I'd have them greedy more then anything, and that greed is what motivates them fighting werewolves so hard, rather then their weird religions with a touch of greed.<br /> <br /> Also they are way the hell to wishy washy with Pentex being Secret. It was supposed to be very very few individuals in the entire world know about Pentex, and the Garou only understood lots of different companies had wyrm ties. With several up and coming Glasswalkers starting to discover the Conspiracies lead to something called Pentex. But half the time they go the opposite, and Pentex Serves as a brand like Disney that everyone has heard of...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-12T05:13:46-07:00","id":1102766,"title":"","content":"Yes, Pentex would serve best as cabal of board members of the leading corporations on Earth, using the greed of humanity to do the work of the Wyrm, with each company giving 'charitable donations' to non-profits that are fronts for Pentex.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-12T07:11:57-07:00","id":1102796,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1102625-revising-pentex-less-captain-planet-more-substance?p=1102741#post1102741\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well I would have a dash more, people using supernatural powers to make money rather then go on an Antichrist Crusade, and a sprinkle of consequences for when they all that time and money to successful werewolf actions. I mean seriously its not cost effective for Pentex to have been funding a secret Amazon war with 1000 Wolfmen since the 80's.<br /> <br /> In Vampire people cultivate their resources, with Pentex they just flush it all away yet still don't suffer loses. I'd have them greedy more then anything, and that greed is what motivates them fighting werewolves so hard, rather then their weird religions with a touch of greed.<br /> <br /> Also they are way the hell to wishy washy with Pentex being Secret. It was supposed to be very very few individuals in the entire world know about Pentex, and the Garou only understood lots of different companies had wyrm ties. With several up and coming Glasswalkers starting to discover the Conspiracies lead to something called Pentex. But half the time they go the opposite, and Pentex Serves as a brand like Disney that everyone has heard of...</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I always thought Pentex was a brand like IBM or Disney, or Macdonalds etc it was a known quality its just like &quot;did you know Disney secretly owns Exxon, Microsoft, Goldman sachs, and Donald trump&quot; that is the big 'secret&quot; Its that Pentex is pretty much secretly the &quot;WOrst&quot; member of every industry.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-12T08:14:29-07:00","id":1102818,"title":"","content":"First Teams can very easily be moved out of the main body and into a bunch of PMCs and &quot;contracted security personnel&quot; that are being given odd orders. Honestly, I think the real reason that Pentex was presented the way it was, was because that the Storyteller system was made in large part by Tom Dowd, who many might recall as one of the brains behind Shadowrun. Given how big SR was at the time, and the proximity of WW to it, some of the Seretech decision was bound to leak through.<br /> <br /> Though, again, that's not really what you find in Captain Planet, but of course SR, and a different setting with initials of CP, followed by the number 2020. It's the primary part of the &quot;punk&quot; part of Gothic-punk.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-12T10:42:33-07:00","id":1102862,"title":"","content":"Yes, there are some odd similarities. I do think that using mercenary companies like Black Water (now known as Academi) as a place to recruit former soldiers into being Fomori would be a possible route for Pentex (or a similarly unethical corporation) to make money. 'Intensive' training regimes combined with a witch's brew of psychotropics could make even the most strong willed soldier vulnerable to Bane possession. Of course, more humane fomori work better with Possessed rather than with W20.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-12T11:15:57-07:00","id":1102877,"title":"","content":"For me, Pentex creates a bit of a Catch 22.<br /> <br /> On the one hand, the &quot;We're all Wyrm cultists, we dump pollution in rivers, cut down trees, and poison people's food because we love EEVVVILLL. We have whole departments and subsidiaries that do nothing but produce mutants and literally demonically possessed people!&quot; that is the (admittedly exaggerated) official version of Pentex prevents suspension of disbelief for me.<br /> <br /> On the other hand, removing these aspects, such that pretty much any successful corporation at a scale larger than a farmer's roadside stand just serves the Wyrm by accident, removes the need for Pentex entirely (and also causes suspension of disbelief issues).<br /> <br /> My somewhat limited solution is to tone down the first version, rather than shut if off completely. I almost never use canon characters, and the board of directors is usually a nebulous group. Most of them are normal businessmen, others are very cautious and subtle Wyrm cultists. Likewise, Wyrm cultists are lightly interspersed throughout the corporate hierarchy. Pentex has no major divisions which intentionally serve as a way to produce Formori or other horrors. If a Wyrm cultists sees an opportunity to use Pentex to spread Wyrmish influence in a subtle and, hopefully, untraceable way, he will take it. Only the most in-the-know Fera know that Pentex is riddled with Wyrm servants.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://paizo.com/campaigns/RageAcrossIreland/gameplay\" target=\"_blank\">My W20 Play-by-Post Game</a>","edited":{"userid":2760,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2760-formosus","user":"Formosus","date":". 06-12-2017, 02:18 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2760-formosus","name":"Formosus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2760_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-12T11:25:53-07:00","id":1102881,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1102625-revising-pentex-less-captain-planet-more-substance?p=1102796#post1102796\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I always thought Pentex was a brand like IBM or Disney, or Macdonalds etc it was a known quality its just like &quot;did you know Disney secretly owns Exxon, Microsoft, Goldman sachs, and Donald trump&quot; that is the big 'secret&quot; Its that Pentex is pretty much secretly the &quot;WOrst&quot; member of every industry.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, in real life, Pentex being the holding company for everything on Earth is only a slight exaggeration.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/k0pv0.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-12T11:39:25-07:00","id":1102884,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1102625-revising-pentex-less-captain-planet-more-substance?p=1102796#post1102796\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> I always thought Pentex was a brand like IBM or Disney, or Macdonalds etc it was a known quality its just like &quot;did you know Disney secretly owns Exxon, Microsoft, Goldman sachs, and Donald trump&quot; that is the big 'secret&quot; Its that Pentex is pretty much secretly the &quot;WOrst&quot; member of every industry.</div> </div> </div> </div>Monsanto is my go-to metaphor. If you actually tried to live without Monsanto products for a month, you'd be scratching at rocks in the dirt with a stick. Everyone knows they're EEEEEEEEE-ville, but nobody realizes how deep their tentacles go.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial","name":"etherial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar707_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-12T11:43:50-07:00","id":1102885,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Formosus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1102625-revising-pentex-less-captain-planet-more-substance?p=1102877#post1102877\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">For me, Pentex creates a bit of a Catch 22.<br /> <br /> On the one hand, the &quot;We're all Wyrm cultists, we dump pollution in rivers, cut down trees, and poison people's food because we love EEVVVILLL. We have whole departments and subsidiaries that do nothing but produce mutants and literally demonically possessed people!&quot; that is the (admittedly exaggerated) official version of Pentex prevents suspension of disbelief for me.<br /> <br /> On the other hand, removing these aspects, such that pretty much any successful corporation at a scale larger than a farmer's roadside stand just serves the Wyrm by accident, removes the need for Pentex entirely (and also causes suspension of disbelief issues).</div> </div> </div> </div>My version of Pentex is essentially what happens if the Wyrm made an appointment with Disney, Sony, Viacom, Monsanto, or one of the companies listed above and said &quot;Hi, I have all this research I'd like to license to you&quot;. It's not that Pentex is evil for the sake of evil or that it turned evil in the pursuit of profit. It was handed a method to rake in the money and that method happens to be evil and funds evil in return.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial","name":"etherial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar707_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-12T15:58:25-07:00","id":1102935,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1102625-revising-pentex-less-captain-planet-more-substance?p=1102881#post1102881\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, in real life, Pentex being the holding company for everything on Earth is only a slight exaggeration.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's a good picture. And often these corporations also own non-food products as well. For example, Nestle is one of the primary shareholders of L'Oreal, the largest cosmetic company in the world. When you buy L'Oreal hair products, you're giving your money to Nestle. Or how for many years, Phillip Morris (the cigarette company that owns Marlboro) also owned Kraft Foods as well as Miller (the beer company) and started divesting itself, in part, when it came under investigation by for racketeering (which it was eventually found guilty of).<br /> <br /> When you actually start looking into these real life, massive multi-national corporations, something like Pentex actually begins to seem kind of plausible.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-12T16:07:15-07:00","id":1102937,"title":"","content":"Especially when you look at holding companies.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-12T16:14:56-07:00","id":1102940,"title":"","content":"The real question is really whether Pentex is owner of everything or just one of several super-corporations. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Who owns them? The Weaver? The Camarilla? Or, GOSH, humans?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 06-12-2017, 07:18 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-12T17:20:17-07:00","id":1102959,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aya Tari</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1102625-revising-pentex-less-captain-planet-more-substance?p=1102862#post1102862\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yes, there are some odd similarities. I do think that using mercenary companies like Black Water (now known as Academi) as a place to recruit former soldiers into being Fomori would be a possible route for Pentex (or a similarly unethical corporation) to make money. 'Intensive' training regimes combined with a witch's brew of psychotropics could make even the most strong willed soldier vulnerable to Bane possession. Of course, more humane fomori work better with Possessed rather than with W20.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> This gives me an idea. What if Pentex is just the PMC? There are all these wyrm cults that have grown fat on the power of greed and corruption. And these people provide a service. They are the professionals who make monsters to go destroy caerns.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-12T17:23:19-07:00","id":1102960,"title":"","content":"Fomori can destroy a lot more than caerns.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-12T18:04:53-07:00","id":1102966,"title":"","content":"Yes, I was expecting the Pentex update to have Endron collapse and a new PMC as a subsidiary.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-12T18:51:22-07:00","id":1102979,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1102625-revising-pentex-less-captain-planet-more-substance?p=1102881#post1102881\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Well, in real life, Pentex being the holding company for everything on Earth is only a slight exaggeration.</div> </div> </div> </div>No, it's quite clearly a holding company for the listed subsidiaries, as written. STs are free to reduce or expand the influence as fits the game, and W20 added a section for corporations that were doing the same thing, but not a part of the holding web.<br /> <br /> (Also, they're all assumed to be human errands. It's the horror of big business, after all.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-12T21:57:44-07:00","id":1103014,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aya Tari</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1102625-revising-pentex-less-captain-planet-more-substance?p=1102960#post1102960\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Fomori can destroy a lot more than caerns.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Right I mean, they are a corporation that consolodates the best of the best of monsters for a reasonable profit for the various fat and powerful wyrm cults.. if a Pentex First team shows up to support other supernaturals who pay well, that's just you know business...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-12T23:00:24-07:00","id":1103022,"title":"","content":"I tend to make Pentex out as a <i>mostly</i> normal set of corporations. Its management is rotted through with an active Wyrm cult but even that disguised behind a layer of seminars, retreats, team-building, and &quot;development.&quot; Think something like <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/NXIVM\" target=\"_blank\">NXIVM</a>. <br /> <br /> Indeed there isn't generally a need for the cult to nudge business decisions too much, as more often than not the choice that serves the Wyrm is the choice that a rational self-interested marketplace actor without ethical concerns would make anyway.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2507-caitiff-primogen","name":"Caitiff Primogen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2507_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-13T05:45:57-07:00","id":1103093,"title":"","content":"It's probably also worth considering that in Werewolf that many mundane actions have a spiritual/supernatural effect and that the dark aspects of our own world are write LARGE in the WoD. The huge massive bulk of Pentex is just as people have described or suggested it should be. Corporations and businesses that are built solely around profit margins and mundane business activity, but the day hours are longer, the holiday allowances fewer, sickness tolerances probably less with disciplinary common for what might be felt to be innocuous things, but there's some carrot with the stick so the bonus incentives will be achievable but massively competitive, there will be loyalty aspects to the company (report your workmates for even the most minor breach of protocol for bennies). This all feeds the Wyrm, but everyone remains very ignorant of anything to do with that, everyone except the Board, Division Heads and other Upper (and some Middle) management positions. <br /> <br /> Those at the top grow rich and wealthy on the workings of the Companies, Divisions and other aspects of the Pentex MegaCorp. That's their main driving goal. Those in the Know also gain supernatural 'insight' and 'benefits' to go hand in hand with their material gains and wealth and also have their own Wyrm fueled agenda for what ever reason you care to ascribe to it. They have the First Teams and Fomori because some of the Private Divisions of Pentex don't exist to make money, but exist to drive the Wyrm based goals, sometimes they get to make money in the process, but those goals mean tangling with Garou and the people in charge know this. So they turn some of that vast mundane wealth and the spiritual supernatural gains into a method to deal with Gaia's warriors. But Pentex's big weapon is one of spiritual blight of humanity and there are tons of ways to do this without First Teams, Fectori and slavering monsters. Charitable concerns can boast a corporate sponsor here and there, medical facilities almost always has business involved somewhere (totally in the USA, increasingly so in the UK), education centers also are a target for big business grants or scholarships and all of these allow for the dark roots of Pentex to infect and spread. This all makes money for the companies that form under the Pentex umbrella and the world grows just that little bit darker and rots just a little more all the way.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2767-moirdryd","name":"Moirdryd","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2767_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"490"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-13T11:43:40-07:00","id":1103226,"title":"","content":"I actually had one of the PCs meet with Harold Zettler last night (it was more of a cutscene because my WOD is every one of my campaigns so it was the Vampire PCs of the vampire game while we're playing the Werewolf sections of &quot;Under a Blood Red Moon&quot;). It got me a chance to have him explain the goal and purpose of Pentex in my campaign. Specifically, Harold's goal was to destroy all supernaturals but vampires and enrich himself as well science as a whole. The service of the &quot;Wyrm&quot; was to him something which superstitious Garou (the BSD) believed in when it was really just an organization assembled around study of supernatural phenomenon as well as putting it to use. Yes, there were the use of spirits and placation of them but that was just a tool.<br /> <br /> Eliminating Lupines was a primary importance to the company but Garou viewed everything through their lens of how society worked.<br /> <br /> Zettler also made it clear it was an alliance of numerous rich supernaturals with their own agendas but his was the one (presently) dominating.<br /> <br /> I had a lot of fun with the meeting because the BSD in my UTBRM game were summoning Eater of Souls in New York City (not Chicago) while Pentex protected them as well as preventing the government from sending troops in to quell the chaos in the city. It made Pentex seem threatening as well as competent but also grossly ignorant suckers too.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-14T00:28:53-07:00","id":1103406,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1102625-revising-pentex-less-captain-planet-more-substance?p=1103226#post1103226\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I actually had one of the PCs meet with Harold Zettler last night (it was more of a cutscene because my WOD is every one of my campaigns so it was the Vampire PCs of the vampire game while we're playing the Werewolf sections of &quot;Under a Blood Red Moon&quot;). It got me a chance to have him explain the goal and purpose of Pentex in my campaign. Specifically, Harold's goal was to destroy all supernaturals but vampires and enrich himself as well science as a whole. The service of the &quot;Wyrm&quot; was to him something which superstitious Garou (the BSD) believed in when it was really just an organization assembled around study of supernatural phenomenon as well as putting it to use. Yes, there were the use of spirits and placation of them but that was just a tool.<br /> <br /> Eliminating Lupines was a primary importance to the company but Garou viewed everything through their lens of how society worked.<br /> <br /> Zettler also made it clear it was an alliance of numerous rich supernaturals with their own agendas but his was the one (presently) dominating.<br /> <br /> I had a lot of fun with the meeting because the BSD in my UTBRM game were summoning Eater of Souls in New York City (not Chicago) while Pentex protected them as well as preventing the government from sending troops in to quell the chaos in the city. It made Pentex seem threatening as well as competent but also grossly ignorant suckers too.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> What Zettler believes is heavily biased by the fact that we objectively know he's crazy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-14T00:39:11-07:00","id":1103408,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1102625-revising-pentex-less-captain-planet-more-substance?p=1103406#post1103406\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What Zettler believes is heavily biased by the fact that we objectively know he's crazy.</div> </div> </div> </div>He's not so much crazy as dealing with alternative facts.<br /> <br /> ...<br /> <br /> Sorry, I couldn't resist.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-14T01:51:15-07:00","id":1103419,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1102625-revising-pentex-less-captain-planet-more-substance?p=1103408#post1103408\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> He's not so much crazy as dealing with alternative facts.<br /> <br /> ...<br /> <br /> Sorry, I couldn't resist.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Now now, he's not that detached from reality.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-14T11:09:41-07:00","id":1103551,"title":"","content":"I've made massive changes to Pentex in my chronicles keeping only the core idea and the names.<br /> <br /> The first thing I do is reduce and split off the number of corporations Pentex controls. Some of the businesses work fine, but I don't see why Pentex would control them. If one wants to run a story idea around an RPG company actually leading its consumers to the occult, then Black Dog Game company works fine and doesn't need to be controlled by Pentex. In fact, I think it works better as an independent company founded by people who independently were contacted and corrupted by Banes. There are others that work best alone too. Then there are all the companies which I don't think work well as antagonists. How many people really use Consolidex Worldwide and explore the world of high expense mutual funds?<br /> <br /> The second thing I do is rationalize the business practices and organization. I jettison the characters I find are over the top and make sure it's actually run like a business. So nothing like in Rage Across Amazon where it states Pentex' businesses actually lose money so they can destroy the environment. If that were true, Pentex wouldn't exist that long.<br /> <br /> Third, I have the core Pentex be the actual old line industrial corporations responsible for most of the pollution - petroleum, mining, chemicals, heavy manufacturing - and give it a more refined mission. Inspired by They Live, this Pentex actually has a very specific mission - to anti-terraform the planet to prepare for the arrival of their new alien masters from the Deep Umbra (some of whom are trapped here on Earth like the Bane that Jeremiah Lassater found). In the meantime, they'll get rich and some of them will be modified to survive just as well on the new Earth that is to come (the Toad fomori). As part of this, they do have First Teams and a Special Projects Division. If I ever do need something related to Pentex that the PCs can go after, usually it is a very small company recently purchased by Pentex that would make a good target to destroy and not overall effect Pentex. &quot;Pentex&quot; itself is less a holding company than an organized conspiracy born out of the original Premium Oil board meeting. None of their holding companies or other assets actually use &quot;Pentex&quot; as a name or logo.<br /> <br /> Fourth, I take some of the independent companies and build their own Fomori cult around them. Siren Cosmetics exists and has Enticers, but some variant of them has existed since the Classical Age as part of the Cult of the Urge Wyrm Karnala. This is simply a new iteration of a long existing problem. Magadon is also its own entity, controlled by a cult to the two Maeljin Incarna of Lord Collum,Master of Sludge, and Lady Yul, the Mistress of Toxins. Although the elemental wyrms Hr'ugg is defined as sludge, i go more with &quot;corrupted earth&quot; meaning &quot;corrupted soil&quot; and is more like the Cthulhu Mythos concept of Abhoth but which spawns off non-Gaian life. Their combined cult infiltrated the company by having agents join their R&amp;D and rising to the top and now control the company. They are aware of the Pentex conspiracy and occassionally work with them, which causes the Garou to believe they are actually part of it, but they are in fact independent and have their own agenda. Their eventual goal is to create a &quot;new perfect race&quot; with the secrets of genetics and life learned from the Maeljin Incarna.<br /> <br /> Fifth, I keep some of the companies, now independent, and don't make them as part of a conspiracy to actively make Fomori, but that they inadvertently make Fomori as a result of the chemicals, additives, and other artificial products used in the creation of their own products (many of which are provided by Pentex). So I do use O'Tolleys, but Fomori only result after extremely long use/consumption of their products by specific individuals and in fairly unique circumstances.<br /> <br /> Sixth, I take the names of Project: Iliad, Project: Odyssey, and Project: Aenied and turn them into my version of Stephen King's The Shop (his fictional government agency of Department of Scientific Intelligence that is shown in Firestarter and others). In my chronicles, these are part of a top secret government intelligence program began in the 1950s which subsequently went rogue after it was officially shut down. These people know of the existence of the supernatural as part of their explorations into the supernatural (for national security reasons) and began creating Fomori in an attempt to give humanity defenses against them so they can fight the monsters. Now it exists as an extra-governmental conspiracy inside and outside the US government, kind of like an evil Delta Green. The project names are well known as part of conspiracy theory up there with the Philadelphia Experiment and MK Ultra. In conspiracy theories, it is called EPIC, but the group itself refers to itself as the Commission.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3046,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","user":"Black Fox","date":". 06-14-2017, 02:18 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","name":"Black Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-23T00:19:11-07:00","id":1106909,"title":"","content":"In Book of the Wyrm 1st edition<br /> <br /> It says Pentexes goal is to &quot;Lift humanity up&quot; and to &quot;Make it the Master of the flesh&quot;<br /> <br /> To conquer ravages, like disease, starvation, even old age","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt